<report>
<title>Diagnostic test analysis</title>
<table>
<tr><td></td><th colspan="3">Disease / feature</th></tr>
<tr><th>Test:</th><td>Present</td><td>Absent</td><td>Totals</td></tr>
<tr><td>Positive</td><td>@aa</td><td>@bb</td><td><subtotal>@ab</subtotal></td></tr>
<tr><td>Negative</td><td>@cc</td><td>@dd</td><td><subtotal>@cd</subtotal></td></tr>
<tr><td>Totals</td><td><subtotal>@ac</subtotal></td><td><subtotal>@bd</subtotal></td><td><grandtotal>@tot</grandtotal></td></tr>
</table>

<p><ci>Including @{pc:round2}% confidence intervals:</ci></p>

<p><b>Prevalence</b> (pre-test likelihood of disease)<br />
@{prevalence:roundu} <ci>(@{prevalence_from:roundu} to @{prevalence_to:roundu}@{prevalence_warn})</ci>, @{prevalence_pc:round2}% <ci>(@{prevalence_from_pc:round2}% to @{prevalence_to_pc:round2}%)</ci></p>

<p><b>Predictive value of +ve test </b>(post-test likelihood of disease)<br />
@{likely:roundu} <ci>(@{likely_from:roundu} to @{likely_to:roundu}@{likely_warn})</ci>, @{likely_pc:round2}% <ci>(@{likely_from_pc:round2}% to @{likely_to_pc:round2}%)</ci>,  {change = @{likely_change:round2}%}</p>

<p><b>Predictive values of -ve test</b><br />
(post-test likelihood of no disease)<br />
@{likely_negative:roundu} <ci>(@{likely_negative_from:roundu} to @{likely_negative_to:roundu}@{likely_negative_warn})</ci>, @{likely_negative_pc:round2}% <ci>(@{likely_negative_from_pc:round2}% to @{likely_negative_to_pc:round2}%)</ci>,  {change = @{likely_negative_change:round2}%}<br />
(post-test disease likelihood despite -ve test)<br />
@{likely_despite:roundu} <ci>(@{likely_despite_from:roundu} to @{likely_despite_to:roundu}@{likely_despite_warn})</ci>, @{likely_despite_pc:round2}% <ci>(@{likely_despite_from_pc:round2}% to @{likely_despite_to_pc:round2}%)</ci>, {change = @{likely_despite_change:round2}%}</p>

<p><b>Sensitivity </b>(true positive rate)<br />
@{sensitive:roundu} <ci>(@{sensitive_from:roundu} to @{sensitive_to:roundu}@{sensitive_warn})</ci>, @{sensitive_pc:round2}% <ci>(@{sensitive_from_pc:round2}% to @{sensitive_to_pc:round2}%)</ci></p>

<p><b>Specificity </b>(true negative rate)<br />
@{specific:roundu} <ci>(@{specific_from:roundu} to @{specific_to:roundu}@{specific_warn})</ci>, @{specific_pc:round2}% <ci>(@{specific_from_pc:round2}% to @{specific_to_pc:round2}%)</ci></p>

<p><b>Likelihood Ratio</b><br />
LR (positive test) = @{lr_pos:roundu}  <ci>(@{lr_pos_from:roundu} to @{lr_pos_to:roundu})</ci><br />
LR (negative test) = @{lr_neg:roundu}  <ci>(@{lr_neg_from:roundu} to @{lr_neg_to:roundu})</ci></p>

<p><b>Diagnostic Odds Ratio</b><br />
<b>Observed odds ratio = @{odr:roundu}</b><br />
<b>Conditional maximum likelihood estimate = @{cmle:roundu}  <ci>(@{cmle_from:roundu} to @{cmle_to:roundu})</ci></b></p>
</report>
